<h2 class="text-secondary">Executive Board</h2><hr/>
<% id = modal('Functions of the Executive Board', size: :lg) do %>
  <ol>
    <li>To maintain a list of the SeqCode Community members.</li>
    <li>Work with the officers of ISME to encourage recruitment to the
      SeqCode Community and promote the goals of the SeqCode Committee.</li>
    <li>To consider exceptional applications for membership of the SeqCode
      Community from non-members of ISME.</li>
    <li>To organise plenary meetings of the SeqCode Committee, in physical
      or online formats, as deemed necessary and not less than once per
      term</li>
    <li>To organise meetings, in physical or online formats, to promote the
      SeqCode and microbial systematics.</li>
    <li>To consider proposals for subcommittees on taxonomy and to establish
      <i>ad hoc</i> ‘Task &amp; Finish’ Working Groups as deemed
      necessary</li>
    <li>To organise elections of officers of the SeqCode Committee
      administrative components, including its own Chair, Vice Chair, and
      Secretary</li>
    <li>To maintain the Statutes of the SeqCode Committee as a publicly
      accessible ‘living document’ and consider any requests to amend the
      Statutes following the process outlined in Article 16 of the SeqCode
      Committee Statutes.</li>
    <li>To receive and disseminate biennial written reports from the
      administrative components.</li>
    <li>To report annually and as requested to the ISME Executive
      Board.</li>
  </ol>
<% end %>
<p class="lead">
  The Executive Board manages the constituent components of the SeqCode
  Committee.
  <%= modal_button(id, class: 'text-primary') do %>
    Functions of the Executive Board
  <% end %>.
</p>
